usage: run_computer10.py [-h] [--alire-dir ALIRE_DIR] [--run-id RUN_ID]
                         [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--wall-seconds WALL_SECONDS]
                         [--portfolio-only] [--provers PROVERS]

Run source-pinned, fresh GNATprove campaigns on computer10. Only SPARK proof
projects are certified. Ada numerical libraries and simulations have a
separate numerical-validation boundary documented beside each project.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --alire-dir ALIRE_DIR
  --run-id RUN_ID
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --wall-seconds WALL_SECONDS
  --portfolio-only
  --provers PROVERS
